    <string name="settings_discord_risk_title">Before you connect Discord</string>
    <string name="settings_discord_risk_body">Discord has no official way for a phone app to set your status, so Stash signs in as you and uses your account\'s own session. Discord\'s rules call that a self-bot and allow them to action the account.\n\nEnforcement goes after spam rather than status updates, so this is unlikely — but it is your account, so it is your call.\n\nDisconnecting clears your status and deletes the token from this phone.</string>
